{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield your sword and relive the golden age of beat 'em ups!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blades &amp; Battles combines the spirit of classics like Golden Axe with the intensity of stylized 3D combat in 2.5D. Explore a fantasy world inspired by the legends of King Arthur and fight in epic battles that will shape the fate of the Round Table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284260/extras/e267444230d2789e207fe433baa1e4d1.poster.avif?t=1770650768\" width=780 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284260/extras/e267444230d2789e207fe433baa1e4d1.webm?t=1770650768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Arthur or Lancelot, each with unique abilities, distinct fighting styles, and devastating special attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284260/extras/a3c7f878965b3231970c762d8b75bc58.poster.avif?t=1770650768\" width=780 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284260/extras/a3c7f878965b3231970c762d8b75bc58.webm?t=1770650768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284260/extras/a3c7f878965b3231970c762d8b75bc58.mp4?t=1770650768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face hordes of enemies in local co-op battles and relive the glory of arcades with a modern, cinematic, action-packed presentation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284260/extras/a2e747feba5b80013f3f86680b526272.poster.avif?t=1770650768\" width=780 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284260/extras/a2e747feba5b80013f3f86680b526272.webm?t=1770650768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284260/extras/a2e747feba5b80013f3f86680b526272.mp4?t=1770650768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two legendary heroes: play as Arthur or Lancelot, each with their own weapons and moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op: fight alongside a friend in cooperative campaign mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized 2.5D visuals: 3D art with a pixelated filter that blends the new and the nostalgic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic beat 'em up reimagined: straightforward action, combos, spells, and colossal bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mythical story: discover the adventures that precede the formation of the Round Table.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With beautiful 3D environments featuring a retro pixel filter, Blades &amp; Battles is a love letter to the classics of the 90s, reinvented for a new generation of knights and indie game fans.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3284260?t=1770650768","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284260/d48b84a02a206ec453d87037a2a332a77216d1a5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770650768","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284260/a3715c98253eb9e54667970e825e2464a02f1666/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770650768","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284260/a